\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Why Vouch declined, by change family (Claude-built programs, main test set). Pairs: program--question pairs. Wrong: wrong answers under the platform check alone. Kept: wrong answers Vouch releases. Detect and Abstain: wrong answers removed / correct answers lost by declines that detect a problem (\textsf  {Caught}\xspace  , \textsf  {Already caught}\xspace  , \textsf  {Failed history check}\xspace  ) and by declines that abstain (\textsf  {Untestable}\xspace  , \textsf  {Can't express}\xspace  ). Manufacturing is omitted: no program gave a wrong answer there, and Vouch abstained on 9 correct answers. The totals include it.}}{8}{table.caption.30}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:families}{{4}{8}{Why Vouch declined, by change family (Claude-built programs, main test set). Pairs: program--question pairs. Wrong: wrong answers under the platform check alone. Kept: wrong answers Vouch releases. Detect and Abstain: wrong answers removed / correct answers lost by declines that detect a problem (\Caught , \Already , \Failhist ) and by declines that abstain (\Untestable , \Cantexpress ). Manufacturing is omitted: no program gave a wrong answer there, and Vouch abstained on 9 correct answers. The totals include it}{table.caption.30}{}}
